fin-sprites-a 2026-11-26: bot_icon.png: chess.com robot bot icon redrawn as clean flat vector art from the video crop by an image model, 512px.
m-art 2026-11-26: piece sprites replaced by chess.com's exact variant piece art (same drawings as the video's 160px crops, now 512px transparent, chess.com's own layout in the square): the inline SVG templates of chess.com's variants client https://www.chess.com/r2/client-packages/variants/2026.11.4/variants.js (current piece theme), ___COLORCODE___ set to the colour sampled from the old video crop (red #bf3b43 / green #4e9161 are chess.com's 4PC colours), rendered in headless Chromium:
  archbishop_r.png = Ye.Archbishop, fill #bf3b43
  bishop_r.png = Ye.Bishop, fill #bf3b43
  general_g.png = Ye.General, fill #4e9161
  general_r.png = Ye.General, fill #bf3b43
  king_r.png = Ye.King, fill #bf3b43
  nightrider_g.png = Ye.KnightRider, fill #4e9161
  nightrider_r.png = Ye.KnightRider, fill #bf3b43
  queen_r.png = Ye.Queen, fill #bf3b43
  sergeant_g.png = Ye.Sergeant, fill #4e9161
  sergeant_r.png = Ye.Sergeant, fill #bf3b43
  soldier_g.png = Ye.Soldier, fill #4e9161
  soldier_r.png = Ye.Soldier, fill #bf3b43
  wildebeest_r.png = Ye.Wildebeest, fill #bf3b43
cm_acc 2026-11-26:
  ferz_r.png = Red's royal Ferz ("Spiky"), drawn as a vector from the 1:55 1080p frame (research/frames/video_thumbs/boaA9_TjXeU_frame_115.jpg, square k1 under its 72 counter: spike tip, tiered cone, wide foot), fill #bf3b43, same outline/highlight style as the variant set; tools/art_thermo_ferz.py. Not chess.com's file (their variants client returns 403 here); a redraw of what the video shows.
  king_g.png, queen_g.png, archbishop_g.png, wildebeest_g.png = the red sprites above recoloured to the board green #4e9161 (tools/art_thermo_green.py; same transform reproduces the template-rendered general_g.png to ~1/255). Green's kings, archbishops and wildebeests are on the 1:55 board; green queens come from soldier promotions (29:01).
  Wall squares use assets/modes/xg_djfCrRes/stone_wall.png (the same chess.com cobblestone wall tile the 1:55 frame shows).
